	"title"				"Atmos: Human Start Boost"
	"description"		"[h1]Atmos: Human Start Boost[/h1]
Configurable human-only sight, movement and starting units for Civilization VI.

[h2]Replaces[/h2]
[list]
[*]Extra Starting Settler (Human Players Only)
[*]Sight Enhance
[*]Move +2 (Human Only)
[*]Player's first settler grants +N movement/+N Sight
[/list]

[h2]Advanced Setup defaults[/h2]
[list]
[*]Sight +2
[*]Movement +2
[*]+1 Settler, +1 Builder, +2 Scouts, +0 Warriors
[/list]

Human players only. Respects unique unit replacements (e.g. Cree Okihtcitaw instead of Scout).
[b]Disable the old similar mods or bonuses will stack.[/b]

[h2]RU[/h2]
Настраиваемые бонусы обзора, хода и стартовых юнитов только для человека. Замена Sight/Move/Settler-модов."
	"changenote"		"Metadata + content refresh"
}
